  storyText: {fileID: 189909866}
  fullScreenCanvasGroup: {fileID: 1056668417}
  typingSpeed: 0.03
  audioSFXName: TypewriterChar
  storyPages:
  - '<color=#27FF00>[ INITIALIZING ENCRYPTED CONNECTION... ]

    [ ROUTING THROUGH
    PROXY: SECURE ]</color>'
  - 'TRUTH CORP controls the news.

    They lie to millions of people every day.'
  - 'They call it news.

    It is pure brainwashing.'
  - We are here to stop them.
  - 'You will break through their outer security.

    to their Local Network...'
  - 'Your mission is clear:

    Find their secrets and expose them to the world.'
  - '<color=#27FF00>[ ACCESS GRANTED: LOCAL_NET_NODE_01 ]

    [ BEGIN OPERATION
    ]</color>'
